### Connect to the subscription listen WebSocket
# On connect the server sends back the tenant info derived from the JWT.
# Requires env var `wsHostname` (e.g. "localhost:8081") — {{hostname}} includes
# the "http://" scheme and can't be reused here.
WEBSOCKET ws://{{wsHostname}}/subscriptions/listen/test2_subscription_heater_2012
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}